The language packs (languages/*/model.bin) hold counts and word lists derived from these
sources. No text of the sources is shipped.

English (languages/en):
- Project Gutenberg books (https://www.gutenberg.org): public domain in the USA. The book
  numbers are in languages/en/build.json.
- Tatoeba (https://tatoeba.org), English sentences, export of 2026-10-31: CC BY 2.0 FR,
  by the Tatoeba contributors (https://tatoeba.org/en/users/all). Each sentence's author is
  on its page, https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/<id>.
- Moby Word Lists by Grady Ward (Project Gutenberg ebook 3201): public domain.

The common-password list behind is_password (src/passwords.rs, wordlists/passwords/) is
unchanged from gibberish-or-not 5.x.

The benchmark corpus (bench/corpus/v1, not part of the published crate) also contains
Wikipedia text (CC BY-SA 4.0, evaluation only) and data from Ciphey
(https://github.com/bee-san/Ciphey, MIT); see bench/corpus/v1/README.md.
